    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FOX XII</strong> is a <strong> hybrid shooter</strong> that blends intense combat, dungeon crawling, and deep rogue-lite progression. Battle through procedurally generated dungeons, uncover powerful loot, and evolve your build with every run in this action-packed ARPG experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791390/extras/8518fa2719ce8276c3c3ddddad4a1160.avif?t=1753891306\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a spec-ops soldier trapped in an unfamiliar and supernatural environment where every corridor hides enemies, secrets, loot, and gear. Swap freely between top-down tactical gunfights and over-the-shoulder third-person precision as you adapt to shifting threats and unique room layouts. Death is not the end. Each run builds your permanent skills, unlocking new abilities, weapons, and combat styles.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FOX XII</strong> is a <strong> hybrid shooter</strong> that blends intense combat, dungeon crawling, and deep rogue-lite progression. Battle through procedurally generated dungeons, uncover powerful loot, and evolve your build with every run in this action-packed ARPG experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791390/extras/8518fa2719ce8276c3c3ddddad4a1160.avif?t=1753891306\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a spec-ops soldier trapped in an unfamiliar and supernatural environment where every corridor hides enemies, secrets, loot, and gear. Swap freely between top-down tactical gunfights and over-the-shoulder third-person precision as you adapt to shifting threats and unique room layouts. Death is not the end. Each run builds your permanent skills, unlocking new abilities, weapons, and combat styles.</p>",
    "short_description": "Switch between top-down and third-person while engaging in intense dungeon combat packed with deadly foes and loot. Return to base camp to craft new upgrades and progress the storyline. Each run delivers unpredictable challenges and endless roguelike excitement.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
